<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PhyCollide Simulation</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome untuk Ikon -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- MathJax untuk Render Rumus LaTeX (Kuis) -->
    <script>
        window.MathJax = {
            tex: {
                inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\(', '\\)']],
                displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\[', '\\]']]
            },
            svg: {
                fontCache: 'global'
            }
        };
    </script>
    <script id="MathJax-script" async src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        primary: '#4f46e5',   // Indigo 600
                        'primary-light': '#818cf8', // Indigo 400
                        secondary: '#0ea5e9', // Sky 500
                        dark: '#0f172a',      // Slate 900
                        obj1: '#f43f5e',      // Rose 500 (Benda 1)
                        'obj1-soft': '#fff1f2',
                        obj2: '#0ea5e9',      // Sky 500 (Benda 2)
                        'obj2-soft': '#f0f9ff',
                        restitution: '#f59e0b', // Amber 500
                        'restitution-soft': '#fffbeb',
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'soft': '0 4px 20px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)',
                        'inner-soft': 'inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8fafc; /* Slate 50 */
            background-image: radial-gradient(#e2e8f0 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 32px 32px;
        }

        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        .hidden-view {
            display: none !important;
        }

        input[type=range] {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            width: 100%;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #e2e8f0; /* Slate 200 */
            outline: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        
        input[type=range]:hover {
            background: #cbd5e1;
        }

        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            appearance: none;
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            border: 3px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent);
            border: 3px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.15s;
        }

        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.15);
        }

        .numfield {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .numfield:focus {
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft, #e0e7ff);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }
        input[type=number]::-webkit-inner-spin-button { opacity: 1; }

        .chip {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .chip:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        .chip.active {
            color: #ffffff !important;
            border-color: transparent !important;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px -2px var(--accent-shadow);
        }

        details {
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        details > summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            list-style: none;
            user-select: none;
        }
        details > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
            display: none;
        }
        details[open] > summary .arrow-icon {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        .step-eq {
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
            font-family: 'Inter', monospace; /* Pseudo-math look */
        }
        
        .blob-bg {
            position: absolute;
            filter: blur(80px);
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.4;
        }

        /* Animasi Tombol Pilihan Ganda Kuis */
        .option-btn {
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-primary selection:text-white relative overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- Dekorasi Background -->
    <div class="blob-bg bg-primary-light w-96 h-96 rounded-full top-0 left-[-10%]"></div>
    <div class="blob-bg bg-secondary w-96 h-96 rounded-full top-40 right-[-10%] opacity-20"></div>

    <nav class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-slate-200/50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between h-16">
                <div class="flex items-center cursor-pointer group" onclick="navigateTo('home')">
                    <!-- Logo / Judul -->
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-md group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-atom"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-dark">Phy<span class="text-primary">Collide</span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Menu Desktop -->
                <div class="hidden sm:ml-6 sm:flex sm:items-center sm:space-x-2">
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('home')" class="nav-btn text-slate-500 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all">Beranda</button>
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('materi')" class="nav-btn text-slate-500 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all">Materi</button>
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('simulasi')" class="nav-btn text-primary bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold shadow-sm transition-all border border-indigo-100">Simulasi</button>
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('latihan')" class="nav-btn text-slate-500 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all">Latihan Soal</button>
                </div>
                <!-- Tombol Menu Mobile -->
                <div class="flex items-center sm:hidden">
                    <button onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-primary focus:outline-none p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-xl"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Menu Mobile Dropdown -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden sm:hidden bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-slate-100 absolute w-full shadow-lg">
            <div class="pt-2 pb-4 space-y-1 px-4">
                <button onclick="navigateTo('home'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="mobile-nav-btn block w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-base font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl transition-colors">Beranda</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('materi'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="mobile-nav-btn block w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-base font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl transition-colors">Materi</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('simulasi'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="mobile-nav-btn block w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-base font-bold text-primary bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 transition-colors">Simulasi</button>
                <button onclick="navigateTo('latihan'); toggleMobileMenu()" class="mobile-nav-btn block w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-base font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-primary hover:bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl transition-colors">Latihan Soal</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col relative z-10">
        <!-- ================= HALAMAN BERANDA ================= -->
        <div id="view-home" class="view-section hidden-view flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 fade-in">
            <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 text-primary font-semibold text-sm mb-6 border border-indigo-200">
                    <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
                      <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75"></span>
                      <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-primary"></span>
                    </span>
                    Simulasi Fisika Interaktif
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-dark mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                    Pahami Konsep Tumbukan dengan <br class="hidden sm:block">
                    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary">Visualisasi Nyata</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    PhyCollide Simulation hadir untuk membantumu memvisualisasikan konsep abstrak momentum dan tumbukan secara interaktif, dilengkapi kalkulator matematis otomatis.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('simulasi')" class="bg-primary text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-indigo-700 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-indigo-500/40 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-lg">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Mulai Simulasi
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="navigateTo('materi')" class="bg-white text-slate-700 border-2 border-slate-200 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 active:scale-95 transition-all text-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Baca Materi
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ================= HALAMAN MATERI ================= -->
        <div id="view-materi" class="view-section hidden-view flex-grow w-full py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 fade-in">
            <!-- Container Materi -->
            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl shadow-soft border border-slate-200/60 overflow-hidden">
                
                <!-- Header Materi -->
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary p-8 sm:p-12 text-center text-white relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 opacity-10 transform translate-x-1/4 -translate-y-1/4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-atom text-9xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <span class="inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white text-sm font-bold tracking-wider mb-4 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/30">MODUL PEMBELAJARAN</span>
                        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight">Momentum, Impuls, <br class="hidden sm:block">dan Tumbukan</h2>
                        <p class="text-indigo-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">Materi esensial Fisika Fase F untuk memahami interaksi gerak dan gaya dalam kehidupan sehari-hari.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Konten Materi -->
                <div class="p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 space-y-12 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                    
                    <!-- 1. Momentum & 2. Impuls (Grid) -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <!-- Momentum -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-inner-soft">
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4"><span class="text-primary">1.</span> Momentum</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4 text-slate-600">Momentum adalah besaran yang menyatakan keadaan gerak suatu benda. Momentum dipengaruhi oleh massa dan kecepatan benda.</p>
                            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-primary p-4 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm mb-4 font-semibold text-center text-xl font-mono text-primary">
                                p = m &times; v
                            </div>
                            <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-slate-500 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                                <li><b>p</b> = momentum (kg&middot;m/s)</li>
                                <li><b>m</b> = massa benda (kg)</li>
                                <li><b>v</b> = kecepatan benda (m/s)</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600">Momentum merupakan <b>besaran vektor</b>, arahnya sama dengan arah kecepatan. Semakin besar massa atau kecepatan benda, semakin besar momentumnya.</p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Impuls -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-inner-soft">
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4"><span class="text-primary">2.</span> Impuls</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4 text-slate-600">Impuls adalah hasil kali gaya dengan selang waktu gaya tersebut bekerja pada benda.</p>
                            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-secondary p-4 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm mb-4 font-semibold text-center text-xl font-mono text-secondary">
                                I = F &times; &Delta;t
                            </div>
                            <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-slate-500 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                                <li><b>I</b> = impuls (N&middot;s)</li>
                                <li><b>F</b> = gaya (N)</li>
                                <li><b>&Delta;t</b> = selang waktu (s)</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600">Impuls merupakan besaran vektor (searah dengan gaya). <i>Contoh: ketika raket memukul bola, gaya raket bekerja dalam waktu singkat memberikan impuls pada bola.</i></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3. Hubungan Impuls & Momentum -->
                    <div class="border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-10">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4"><span class="text-primary">3.</span> Hubungan Impuls dan Momentum</h3>
                        <p class="mb-4">Impuls berhubungan langsung dengan perubahan momentum benda.</p>
                        
                        <div class="bg-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-indigo-100 text-center mb-6 overflow-x-auto">
                            <div class="font-mono text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 space-y-3">
                                <div>I = &Delta;p</div>
                                <div>I = p<sub>akhir</sub> - p<sub>awal</sub></div>
                                <div class="text-primary">F &times; &Delta;t = m(v<sub>akhir</sub> - v<sub>awal</sub>)</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-secondary mr-2"></i>Artinya, impuls yang diberikan pada benda menyebabkan perubahan momentum benda tersebut.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 4. Hukum Kekekalan Momentum & 5. Energi Kinetik & 6. Konsep Tumbukan -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-10">
                        <div class="space-y-6">
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3"><span class="text-primary">4.</span> Hukum Kekekalan Momentum</h3>
                                <p class="mb-4 text-slate-600">Jika resultan impuls eksternal pada sistem diabaikan, maka momentum total sistem sebelum dan sesudah interaksi adalah sama.</p>
                                <div class="bg-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-4 rounded-r-xl font-mono text-emerald-800 font-bold mb-3">
                                    <div class="mb-2">p<sub>awal</sub> = p<sub>akhir</sub></div>
                                    <div>m<sub>1</sub>v<sub>1</sub> + m<sub>2</sub>v<sub>2</sub> = m<sub>1</sub>v<sub>1</sub>' + m<sub>2</sub>v<sub>2</sub>'</div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic">*Yang kekal adalah momentum total sistem, bukan momentum masing-masing benda.</p>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3"><span class="text-primary">5.</span> Energi Kinetik</h3>
                                <p class="mb-3 text-slate-600">Energi kinetik adalah energi gerak benda. Dalam tumbukan, Energi Kinetik (Ek) tidak selalu kekal.</p>
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-4 rounded-r-xl font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 w-max mb-3">
                                    E<sub>k</sub> = &frac12; m v<sup>2</sup>
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Sebagian E<sub>k</sub> bisa berubah menjadi panas, bunyi, atau deformasi bentuk.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 6. Konsep Tumbukan -->
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-inner-soft">
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4"><span class="text-primary">6.</span> Konsep Tumbukan</h3>
                            <p class="mb-6 text-slate-600">Peristiwa interaksi antara dua benda atau lebih dalam waktu singkat sehingga terjadi perubahan kecepatan.</p>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-700 mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-primary mr-2"></i>Contoh Peristiwa:</h4>
                            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-bowling-ball text-rose-400"></i></div> Bola biliar bertabrakan</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-baseball text-amber-400"></i></div> Bola dipukul raket/tongkat</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-basketball text-orange-400"></i></div> Bola memantul dari lantai</li>
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-car-side text-sky-400"></i></div> Dua kendaraan bertabrakan</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 7. Koefisien Restitusi -->
                    <div class="border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-10">
                        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center mb-8 gap-4">
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2"><span class="text-primary">7.</span> Koefisien Restitusi (e)</h3>
                                <p class="text-slate-600">Koefisien restitusi menyatakan perbandingan kecepatan relatif sesudah vs sebelum tumbukan.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 text-rose-600 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-mono font-bold flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm">
                                e = - 
                                <div class="inline-flex flex-col text-center align-middle">
                                    <span class="border-b border-rose-300 pb-0.5 px-1">(v<sub>2</sub>' - v<sub>1</sub>')</span>
                                    <span class="pt-0.5 px-1">(v<sub>2</sub> - v<sub>1</sub>)</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 8. Jenis Tumbukan -->
                    <div class="border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-10">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6"><span class="text-primary">8.</span> Jenis-Jenis Tumbukan</h3>
                        
                        <!-- 3 Kartu Jenis Tumbukan -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                            <!-- Lenting Sempurna -->
                            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-amber-400"></div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">Lenting Sempurna</h4>
                                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold font-mono">e = 1</span>
                                </div>
                                <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-slate-600 list-disc pl-4 marker:text-amber-400">
                                    <li>Momentum total <b class="text-emerald-600">Kekal</b></li>
                                    <li>Energi kinetik <b class="text-emerald-600">Kekal</b></li>
                                    <li>Model ideal fisika (tidak ada energi yang hilang).</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Lenting Sebagian -->
                            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-sky-400"></div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">Lenting Sebagian</h4>
                                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold font-mono">0 < e < 1</span>
                                </div>
                                <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 text-slate-600 list-disc pl-4 marker:text-sky-400">
                                    <li>Momentum total <b class="text-emerald-600">Kekal</b>*</li>
                                    <li>Energi kinetik <b class="text-rose-500">Berkurang</b></li>
                                    <li>Benda memantul, tapi terpisah.</li>
                                    <li>Contoh nyata: bola mantul ke lantai.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Tidak Lenting -->
                            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                                <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-500"></div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">Tidak Lenting</h4>
